ass="sc-ibQzxG cSbAnC pf-384_ pf-r" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-385_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-386_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Chainsaw Safety Seminar — March 4, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-388_ pf-heading-1-h3">Porter's Lawn &amp; Power Equipment – U.S. 51 Janesville, WI 53546</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-390_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Learn how to handle a chainsaw like a pro and avoid accidents! Choose to attend&nbsp;a&nbsp;morning (11am) or&nbsp;afternoon (1pm)&nbsp;seminar. Plus, have FREE LUNCH at noon. Space is limited, please&nbsp;<b><a href="/pages/spring-open-house" target="_self"></a><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-seminar-tickets-1242317116939?aff=eventcal" target="_self">Reserve Your Spot &gt;</a><a href="/pages/spring-open-house" target="_self"></a>&nbsp;</b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-392_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-393_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Fort Wayne Home &amp; Garden Show — February 27&nbsp;thru March 2, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-395_ pf-heading-1-h3">Allen County War Memorial Coliseum – Fort Wayne, IN</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-397_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Attend the 52nd&nbsp;Annual Fort Wayne Home &amp; Garden Show in Fort Wayne, IN and visit Russo&nbsp;at booth #251. 650+ exhibitors in attendance! Exhibitors feature products and services for kitchen, bath, landscaping, interior decor, bedding, windows, siding, roofing, gutters, patios, driveways, and more. &nbsp;<b><a href="https://home-gardenshow.com/about-the-show/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-399_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-400_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA iLandscape — February 26 - 28, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-402_ pf-heading-1-h3">Renaissance Schaumburg Convention Center Hotel – Schaumburg, IL</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-404_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Attend the 12th annual iLandscape show &amp; sit in on educational sessions, talk with more than 400 exhibitors, and discover the latest trends in the green industry! Visit Russo at Booth #1729.&nbsp;<a href="https://ilandscapeshow.com/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-406_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-407_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA Young Professionals Event — February 13, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-409_ pf-heading-1-h3">Mickey Finn's Brewery – Libertyville, IL</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-411_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join ILCA’s young professionals committee at Mickey Finn’s Brewery in Libertyville, IL for their February event!

Recharging for Success: Understanding and Managing Burnout.&nbsp;<a href="https://indianagreenexpo.com/" target="_blank"><b></b></a><b><a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/young-professionals-event/" target="_self">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-413_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-414_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IGE Indiana Green Expo — February 11 - 12, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-416_ pf-heading-1-h3">Indiana Convention Center  –  Indianapolis, IN</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-418_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Indiana Green Expo two-day Trade Show provides opportunities for turf and landscape professionals to meet with vendors and view the newest products and technology. Plan to be a part of it! Visit Russo at Booth #205 &amp; Haltom at Booth #201.&nbsp;<a href="https://indianagreenexpo.com/" target="_blank"><b><a href="https://indianagreenexpo.com/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-420_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-421_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA InVigorateU Conference — January 28 - 29, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-423_ pf-heading-1-h3">DoubleTree by Hilton – Bloomington, IL</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-425_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">InVigorateU is an annual education conference that not only offers great sessions and CEUs, but also offers a chance to reflect on what worked this season and collaborate with peers about what you might want to do differently in the next to get stronger results. <strong><a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/invigorateu/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-427_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-428_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference — January&nbsp;23 - 24, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-430_ pf-heading-1-h3">Hyatt Regency – Chicago, IL</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-432_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference holds the unique distinction of being the largest state park and recreation conference in the nation. The conference brings together thousands of professionals, Commissioners, and elected officials from around the state for three exciting days of quality educational programming, networking, and professional development. Visit Russo at Booth #234.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank"><b><a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-434_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-435_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Lawn Care Application Timing — January&nbsp;15, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-437_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: New Berlin, WI — 11:00AM Social &amp; Lunch, 1:00PM Seminar Starts</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-439_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>Have questions about applying plant health care products like fertilizers, chemicals, or seed?&nbsp;</strong>Join us for this engaging seminar with Larry Vogel (Spring Valley), Patrick Bastron (PBI Gordon), and Rob Osier (Russo Plant&nbsp;Health Care Manager). They'll address common concerns and share practical tips to boost your confidence and maximize effectiveness in lawn care applications. Whether you're a seasoned pro or just starting out, this event is the perfect opportunity to gain valuable insights. Plus, enjoy a free lunch!&nbsp;<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lawn-care-application-timing-tickets-1132721403209?aff=eventcal" target="_self"><strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lawn-care-application-timing-tickets-1132721403209?aff=eventcal" target="_blank">RSVP today &gt;</a></strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-441_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-442_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILA Holiday Party&nbsp; — Dec 12, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-444_ pf-heading-1-h3">Liter House – Indianapolis, IN</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-446_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join in for a fun night at the ILA's Annual Meeting / Holiday Party featuring Live Music, Guest Comedian, and Raffle Prizes.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://ila.wildapricot.org/event-5927885" target="_self"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-448_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-449_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">WNLA Holiday Party&nbsp; — Dec&nbsp;4, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-451_ pf-heading-1-h3">The Wisconsin Club – Milwaukee, WI</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-453_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join in&nbsp;for a fun evening of networking, celebrating award winners, dinner and drinks!&nbsp;<a href="https://wnla.net/meetinginfo.php?id=60&amp;ts=1728404774" target="_self"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;