graph3">Earn 3 CEUs while learning strategies to diversify your business and keep plants happy &amp; healthy! Sponsored by ArborJet &amp; Ecologel.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1054_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1058_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>ILCA Fire &amp; Ice Summer Field &amp; Snow Day— August 4</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1060_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Cantigny Park in Wheaton, IL<br></b><br>We’re going to be one of over 100 exhibitors at ILCA’s brand-new Fire &amp; Ice summer field and snow day, and we can’t wait to see you! <a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/fire-and-ice/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1062_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1066_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>IAA Tree Climbing Championship — June 25</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1068_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Shiloh Park in Zion, IL<br><br>7am - Competitor gear check
8:15am - Competition preliminary events begin</b><br><br>We’re heading to the IAA Tree Climbing Championship for a day full of competition, fun, and outdoor activities. Our certified arborist, Dan, will be judging the competition and we'll have a booth at the fair. Stop by to learn more about all things arbor! <a href="https://illinoisarborist.org/2022-illinois-tree-climbing-championship/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1070_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1074_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live Online Auction — June 15</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1076_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Elgin </b>- 1001 N Randall Rd, Elgin, IL 60123, USA<b><br><br>Consign By:</b> 5/21   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 6/14</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1078_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1082_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Chainsaw Safety Seminar — June 10</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1084_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Hainesville </b>- 39 East Belvidere Road, Hainesville, IL 60030, USA<br><br>Earn 1.5 ISA CEUs while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from a certified chainsaw technician. We’ll cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1086_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1090_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>APWA Chicago Expo &amp; Roadeo — May 18 &amp; 19</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1092_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Odeum Expo Center in Villa Park, IL</b><br><br>While attending the APWA Expo, stop by our booth, say hi, and we’ll fill you in on all of the exciting news and equipment we have in stock! <a href="http://chicago.apwa.net/Content/Chapters/chicago.apwa.net/Documents/2022%20APWA%20CMC%20Expo%20Exhibitor%20Sponsor%20Information(3).pdf" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1094_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1098_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;In-Person Auction — April 9</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1100_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Auction begins at 8:00am at Russo:</b> Hainesville   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 04/08, Hainesville<br><br>After a long break due to Covid, we're excited to announce the return of our in-person auction! Plan to spend the day bidding on an assortment of high-quality used equipment.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1102_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1106_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Russo Spring Open House</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1108_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We’re happy to announce the long-awaited return of the Russo Open House! Spring Open House features representatives from the most prominent companies in the industry putting on demonstrations and informing customers of the newest products on the market. Save the date for a day full of fun, raffles, giveaways, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1110_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1114_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;Online Auction — March 16</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1116_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>No Consignment   |   Preview Day:</b> 03/15, Elgin</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-1118_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1122_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Service Hiring Event at Schiller Park — March 10 &amp; 11</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1124_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>In-person Interviews &amp; On-the-spot Offers<br></b><br>Meet the staff, see the space, have some food, and have an in-person interview with potential offers! We're hiring multiple people for 3 positions: Service Porters, Service Mechanics, &amp; Lead Service Advisor. All mechanic levels from apprentice to master are welcome to apply! Visit <a href="/pages/careers" target="_self">RussoPower.com/careers</a>&nbsp;7 to see all job opportunities!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
